<div class="about-page">
    <div class="about-hero">
        <h1 class="about-logo">shotify</h1>
        <p class="about-tagline">Product image management and B2B Excel parsing tool</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/sawmeraw/shotify" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="about-github-btn">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor">
                <path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.013 8.013 0 0016 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/>
            </svg>
            View on GitHub
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-card">
            <div class="about-card-icon">
                <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2fa76b" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Web Application</h3>
            <p>ASP.NET Core 10 MVC with Razor views. Handles brand configuration, image URL generation, product search, and an inline image editor.</p>
            <div class="about-tech-tags">
                <span>.NET 10</span>
                <span>EF Core</span>
                <span>Razor</span>
                <span>jQuery</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card">
            <div class="about-card-icon">
                <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2575fc" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="9" y1="13" x2="15" y2="19"/><line x1="15" y1="13" x2="9" y2="19"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Excel Parser</h3>
            <p>Go microservice that parses B2B Excel price lists from brands like Adidas, Nike, and Asics into a standardized output format for the REX system.</p>
            <div class="about-tech-tags">
                <span>Go 1.24</span>
                <span>Excelize</span>
                <span>REST API</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card">
            <div class="about-card-icon">
                <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#e67e22" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Database</h3>
            <p>PostgreSQL 17 with Entity Framework Core. Stores brand configurations, image URL patterns, parameter templates, and fetched product images.</p>
            <div class="about-tech-tags">
                <span>PostgreSQL 17</span>
                <span>EF Core</span>
                <span>Npgsql</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card">
            <div class="about-card-icon">
                <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8e44ad" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 014 10 15.3 15.3 0 01-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 01-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 014-10z"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Infrastructure</h3>
            <p>Hosted on a Linode VPS running Ubuntu. Nginx reverse proxy with SSL termination. Both apps run as systemd services with auto-restart.</p>
            <div class="about-tech-tags">
                <span>Linode</span>
                <span>Nginx</span>
                <span>systemd</span>
                <span>SSL</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card">
            <div class="about-card-icon">
                <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#e74c3c" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>CI/CD</h3>
            <p>GitHub Actions pipeline that builds both applications, transfers self-contained binaries to the VPS via SCP, and performs zero-downtime service restarts.</p>
            <div class="about-tech-tags">
                <span>GitHub Actions</span>
                <span>SCP</span>
                <span>Self-contained</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card">
            <div class="about-card-icon">
                <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1a1a2e" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Auth</h3>
            <p>Password-based JWT authentication with HttpOnly secure cookies. Tokens are signed with HMAC-SHA256 and expire after 12 hours.</p>
            <div class="about-tech-tags">
                <span>JWT</span>
                <span>HttpOnly</span>
                <span>HMAC-SHA256</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-footer-text">
        Built by <a href="https://github.com/sawmeraw" target="_blank" rel="noopener">sawmeraw</a>
    </div>
</div>
